# #5837, the claimless advance: a split resumed by a new donor activation (a5e2e2ef).
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestResumedCloseUsesOnlyOwnHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a split resumed by a new donor activation closes with only that activation's own moved-key high
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
DonorCloseCovers == IF dResumed THEN {o \in Offs : author[o] = DonorLive} ELSE dKnown
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the resumed close uses only the new activation's own high.
DonorCloseCovers == dKnown
--- END
